    summary: "Fundación Valle del Lili is a non-profit university hospital in Cali affiliated with the Universidad Icesi, regularly ranked among the top hospitals in Latin America. Its cancer institute provides medical oncology, radiotherapy, haematology and bone marrow transplantation, surgical oncology, paediatric oncology and nuclear medicine, and its clinical research centre is one of Colombia's most active sites for international oncology trials. The hospital is accredited by Joint Commission International and runs oncology fellowship programmes for the south-west of the country.",
